# $10 EsperMansionB1 is 16 x 8 blocks, the size of a backdrop plane, and
# until build 62 the level extractor placed a plane by its size: plane A
# landed in 10_EsperMansionB1.tmx beside plane B and not in
# 10_EsperMansionB1_A.tmx, where level_load looks whenever the flag
# byte's backdrop bit is set -- "cannot open ..._A.tmx", "no planeA
# layer", a black screen and no level. $52 IkutoGroundF, the other
# 16 x 8 level, is ikuto_ground.route.
#
# Needs `make extract-levels` then `make manifest` with build 62's
# tools/extract_levels.py.

# The mansion's stairs down, F1 15,13.
start level $11 15 14
wait idle
walk up 2
wait idle
expect level $10 16 14
shot 01_esper_b1
walk left 3
wait idle
shot 02_three_left
expect no-stderr level:
